****** Prezley's Directory ******

Last updated 10/2026

Contains MATLAB scripts used for CNN-based breaking wave crest detection from FRF shoreline video imagery + analysis of breaking wave-induced vorticity generation


*******************************************************************************************
FOLDERS (indicated with %) + MATLAB scripts (indicated with *)


% main_workflow - primary MATLAB scripts for processing new mp4s, including: crest tracking with CNN, tracking-derived celerity, bathy inversions, PIV correction, breaking force + vorticity estimation

	* MAIN_FLOW_RECENT.m - loads in mp4 files + camera parameters -> rectifies IMG onto FRF grid -> detects + tracks breaking crests from probability map generated by CNN on frame-by-frame basis -> calculates crest celerity from displacement vectors -> saves crest positions/timestamps + celerity pts + crest widths (WHOLE workspace) to mat_data **** need to change to save to OneDrive instead...

		input: mp4 year/date/time
		output: saves workspace; plots c distribution + histo, optional tracking animation	


	* bathy_inversion.m - loads mp4-derived celerity -> inverts to depths; basic analysis/comparison plots

		input: mp4 year/date/time
		output: binned bathy inversion map, error maps


	* PIV_correction.m - loads celerity -> corrects for wave-current interaction using Doppler correction w/ PIV-derived surface current data -> bathy comparison + error maps

		input: mp4 year/date/time
		output: PIV-corrected bathy, comparison plots, error maps, PIV curl field (vorticity), print out basic stats


	* Fbr_vort.m - loads c, crest widths, offshore wave conditions (T, tide), uses constant roller angle -> calculates along-crest pt-based Fbr + along-crest Fbr curl (proxy for vorticity generation)

		input: mp4 year/date/time, raw/piv celerity data (some days don't have PIV data)
		output: binned Fbr magnitude + direction, single frame Fbr vectors plot (+ with curl), curl(Fbr) map

	
	% functions (subfolder) - function versions of main_workflow that can be run using skeleton_flow.m, functions used in processing + tracking in MAIN_FLOW_RECENT.m

*******************************************************************************************


% analysis - secondary MATLAB scripts for analyzing output from main_workflow + instrument/survey data; includes celerity stats, crest geometry stats, roller angle analysis


*******************************************************************************************


% diagnostic_visualization - secondary MATLAB scripts for diagnosing code/output + visualizing/plotting data; includes bathy surveys, offshore buoy conditions, pressure sensor data, PIV-currrents, mp4 video playback, parabola-fitting visualization, individual frame probability maps, roller angle extraction, crest geometry extraction, frame-by-frame displacement vectors


*******************************************************************************************


% archive_code - old/unused scripts backup


